sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Event as Event
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Event: changePrimaryContact(primaryContactName, primaryContactEmail, primaryContactPhone)
    Note over Event: Policies: eventRead, eventWrite, eventExecute
    Note over Event: Guards (2)
    Event->>Event: guard[0]: self.stage == #quot;planning#quot; or self.stage == #quot;pending_approv...
    Event->>Event: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Event->>Event: mutate.primaryContactName
    Event->>Event: mutate.primaryContactEmail
    Event->>Event: mutate.primaryContactPhone
    Event->>EventBus: emit EventPrimaryContactChanged on event.primary_contact_changed
    Event-->>-Client: void